  "reflectionText": "The psalmist cried from the depths of the night: out of the depths I have cried to you. He said: my soul waits for the Lord more than watchmen wait for the morning. He waited until the sun rose over the eastern wall. What is it to wait through the night for a morning the watchmen also are still waiting to see?"
